{"id":"simpatia","lemma":"simpatia","pos":"noun","rank":4096,"glosses":["likeableness (quality of being likeable)","ritual; rite (set of repeated actions, intending to produce a supernatural result)"],"ipa":"/sĩ.paˈt͡ʃi.ɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"simpatias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-simpatia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu agradeço a sua simpatia.","en":"I thank you for your sympathy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to thank","l":"agradecer"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null]},{"text":"Eu esperava simpatia.","en":"I was hoping for sympathy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},null]},{"text":"Não sinto muita simpatia por Tom.","en":"I don't feel a lot of sympathy for Tom.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to sense","l":"sentir"},{"g":"very, a lot","l":"muito"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"tone"}]},{"text":"Agradeço a sua simpatia.","en":"I thank you for your sympathy.","words":[{"g":"to thank","l":"agradecer"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},null]},{"text":"Com frequência, descobrimos que a simpatia se transforma em amor.","en":"You often find that sympathy turns into love.","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"frequency"},{"g":"to discover","l":"descobrir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to transform","l":"transformar"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"love"}]}]}